  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\"\u0130mparatori\xE7e\" kart\u0131n\u0131 ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in se\xE7tin
    {{isim}}.\n\nBu kart, ge\xE7mi\u015Fte sanc\u0131l\u0131 s\xFCre\xE7lerden ge\xE7ti\u011Fini
    fakat bu sayede ruhsal anlamda b\xFCy\xFCme ve geli\u015Fmeni tamamlad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    beyan etmekte. Her durumda pozitif kalarak kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131n \xFCstesinden gelebilmi\u015F, kendi yolunu
    ve \u015Fans\u0131n\u0131 kendin a\xE7m\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Bolluk ve bereket
    ya\u011Fmurlar\u0131 \xFCzerine i\u015Fte tam da o d\xF6nemlerde ya\u011Fm\u0131\u015F.
    Eline hen\xFCz istedi\u011Fin her \u015Feyin ge\xE7medi\u011Fini d\xFC\u015F\xFCnsen
    de, rengarenk meyvelere gebe dallar ve budaklar, o d\xF6nem uzay\u0131p ye\u015Fermi\u015F.
    Bir k\u0131s\u0131m g\xFCzel haberleri ya o d\xF6nem alm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n
    ya da baz\u0131lar\u0131 bug\xFCnlere saklanm\u0131\u015F."
